    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chaotic and absurd adventure set in a grimy Italian restaurant. Push the laws of Newton to their limits, combine objects with different shapes, and earn stellar reviews to upgrade your waiter setup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396570/extras/cadfc3af4b03bfcee3086cc745fea8bd.poster.avif?t=1738493806\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396570/extras/cadfc3af4b03bfcee3086cc745fea8bd.webm?t=1738493806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396570/extras/cadfc3af4b03bfcee3086cc745fea8bd.mp4?t=1738493806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The cast</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to seven bizarre characters and try to uncover their deepest secrets. A small clue: they\u2019re all obsessed with abnormally tall piles of dishes, and they\u2019re counting on YOU to satisfy their peculiar fetish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396570/extras/d98030076a7f49b5d245fc801dc4d769.avif?t=1738493806\" data-has-big width=800 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The dish towers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A plethora of weird objects is waiting to be piled up on the tray, or dramatically crashed on the ground. Exploit their shape to build daring structures and explore their relationship with Italian food culture and the characters\u2019 stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396570/extras/c20f3aba0a78b8c56785b64fdb1f7001.poster.avif?t=1738493806\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396570/extras/c20f3aba0a78b8c56785b64fdb1f7001.webm?t=1738493806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396570/extras/c20f3aba0a78b8c56785b64fdb1f7001.mp4?t=1738493806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Singleplayer physics-based mechanics that offer a warm welcome for newcomers and expert players alike</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade system built to let you customize your dish-piling setup</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dreamlike story setting with a group of unapologetically outspoken characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Groovy soundtrack that crosses a free-jazz vein with vintage dreamy synths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grungy flat art style inspired by the Italian design of the Sixties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique and grotesque sense of humor</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chaotic and absurd adventure set in a grimy Italian restaurant. Push the laws of Newton to their limits, combine objects with different shapes, and earn stellar reviews to upgrade your waiter setup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396570/extras/cadfc3af4b03bfcee3086cc745fea8bd.poster.avif?t=1738493806\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396570/extras/cadfc3af4b03bfcee3086cc745fea8bd.webm?t=1738493806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396570/extras/cadfc3af4b03bfcee3086cc745fea8bd.mp4?t=1738493806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The cast</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to seven bizarre characters and try to uncover their deepest secrets. A small clue: they\u2019re all obsessed with abnormally tall piles of dishes, and they\u2019re counting on YOU to satisfy their peculiar fetish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396570/extras/d98030076a7f49b5d245fc801dc4d769.avif?t=1738493806\" data-has-big width=800 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The dish towers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A plethora of weird objects is waiting to be piled up on the tray, or dramatically crashed on the ground. Exploit their shape to build daring structures and explore their relationship with Italian food culture and the characters\u2019 stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span clas